            <div xml:id="d372">

                <pb facs="0506" n="495" xml:id="pg495"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.652/143: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Phillips</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rome</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-12-18T12:00:00+01:00">December 18,
                        1937—noon.</date><lb/>[Received December 18—7:44 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>523. My 522, December 18, 11 a.m. In view of approaching holidays could you give
                    me your views as to whether the immediate negotiations suggested are
                    practicable.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
